{{## Idiomatic Scriban -- fragment-heavy stat partial.

     Patterns followed, from Scriban's own documentation:
       language          https://github.com/scriban/scriban/blob/master/doc/language.md
       builtins/html     https://github.com/scriban/scriban/blob/master/doc/builtins.md#html-functions
       runtime/includes  https://github.com/scriban/scriban/blob/master/doc/runtime.md

     Renders one stat row from the scope-shared loop variable `item`. Checked by the
     functional verifier, not the byte gate. Note the multi-line comment delimiters: the
     single-line form ends at the first newline, which would leave the doc URLs to parse as
     expressions. ##}}

<div class="stat">
  <span class="stat-name">{{ item.name }}</span>
  <span class="stat-value">{{ item.value }}</span>
  <span class="stat-delta">{{ item.delta }}</span>
</div>
